        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 61.18b" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="582" ed="#liebermann"/>Negetur itaque statim quod nunquam<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="27" target="#Hn_61-18b.lnote.oe.27"/> sane<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="28" target="#Hn_61-18b.lnote.oe.28"/> fateri<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="29" target="#Hn_61-18b.lnote.oe.29"/> licet; et sit<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="29" target="#Hn_61-18b.lnote.oe.29"/> inde iudicium, an in presenti finiendum an ad terminum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="30" target="#Hn_61-18b.lnote.oe.30"/> differendum sit<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="31" target="#Hn_61-18b.lnote.oe.31"/>, iuxta legalitatem accusantium et cause statum.</ab>
